The "blank black page" issue typically happens because the `importmap` script in your `index.html` is conflicting with the Vite build process on Vercel.

When you deploy to Vercel using Vite, Vite bundles all your dependencies (React, etc.) into JavaScript files. However, the `importmap` in your HTML tells the browser to ignore the bundle and look for React at a specific CDN URL instead. This mismatch causes the application to crash immediately upon loading.

I will remove the `importmap` from `index.html` so the browser uses the correctly bundled code from Vercel.

